{"4168850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Down the Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4168850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Down the Dungeon&quot;</i></strong> is an unforgiving precision platformer that starts you from the top of the dungeon. <u>Without</u> checkpoints, navigate your way around dangerous traps, and rotting enemies - jumping  and crawling through forgotten corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/635c1c1eefea6cee2d2ff699a5ceebac.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect<strong> 9</strong> pieces of gear that provide powerful passives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple main routes down to the bottom with branching hidden pathways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> consumable items. A throwable ember to illuminate the darkness, a dagger to slay creatures and jump on as a makeshift platform, and an apple that replenishes health- green of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b83946e2c17c65de4ae0da213e9f55a4.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b2b196e9b17f909cd90740126435f958.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b2b196e9b17f909cd90740126435f958.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend down the dungeon's multiple pathways, you will encounter increasingly more unforgiving platforming jumps and deadly traps; constantly testing your dexterity and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/98de186b17c6c06a2659859985904e49.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/19d0fc12af2d6b2dc52098dde8a07add.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/19d0fc12af2d6b2dc52098dde8a07add.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between  nerve-wracking jumps, you will encounter the undead -- previous adventurers that have tried to conquer these depths and failed.  <br>Kill them in any ways possible, using throwing knives, or the traps scattered amongst the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b6a92912775f8239de59fcb02d0ffd74.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/ef0f99fa46b173b16e2b87fe503a0824.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/ef0f99fa46b173b16e2b87fe503a0824.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient halls of the dungeons provide many secrets. Use throwing knives as platforms, embers to light the way, and apples to provide health all while crawling through dank corridors -- finding consumables and powerful gear to help you on your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/c89f3ae78b388bfb084d6016010d2177.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/0d20818768664d02592f76f99c739e88.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/0d20818768664d02592f76f99c739e88.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon itself isn't hard enough for you? Try &quot;Hell Unleashed&quot; or the elusive &quot;Bubble World&quot; to further test yourself and your understanding of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/89bf7a9d550a74a3e5213801ea5f3a01.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/5afc67aa328767034d6adca31ca72e54.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/5afc67aa328767034d6adca31ca72e54.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to reach the bottom?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Down the Dungeon&quot;</i></strong> is an unforgiving precision platformer that starts you from the top of the dungeon. <u>Without</u> checkpoints, navigate your way around dangerous traps, and rotting enemies - jumping  and crawling through forgotten corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/635c1c1eefea6cee2d2ff699a5ceebac.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect<strong> 9</strong> pieces of gear that provide powerful passives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple main routes down to the bottom with branching hidden pathways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> consumable items. A throwable ember to illuminate the darkness, a dagger to slay creatures and jump on as a makeshift platform, and an apple that replenishes health- green of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b83946e2c17c65de4ae0da213e9f55a4.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/b2b196e9b17f909cd90740126435f958.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\