471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/ef0f99fa46b173b16e2b87fe503a0824.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient halls of the dungeons provide many secrets. Use throwing knives as platforms, embers to light the way, and apples to provide health all while crawling through dank corridors -- finding consumables and powerful gear to help you on your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/c89f3ae78b388bfb084d6016010d2177.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/0d20818768664d02592f76f99c739e88.poster.avif?t=1771532471\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/0d20818768664d02592f76f99c739e88.webm?t=1771532471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon itself isn't hard enough for you? Try &quot;Hell Unleashed&quot; or the elusive &quot;Bubble World&quot; to further test yourself and your understanding of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/89bf7a9d550a74a3e5213801ea5f3a01.avif?t=1771532471\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168850/extras/5afc67aa328767034d6adca31ca72e54.po